  "headline": "Nitrofurantoin is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; Corvale sites hold about 25.7 days of 50 mg capsules and the top alternate manufacturer is Alembic Pharmaceuticals Limited",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "D1", "D2", "D4"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list shows nitrofurantoin is not listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 353 capsules of the 50 mg presentation at 13.7 per day, giving 25.7 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 409 capsules of the 50 mg presentation at 15.9 per day, also giving 25.7 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule‑based alternate manufacturer ranked first is Alembic Pharmaceuticals Limited, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alembic Pharmaceuticals Limited is identified on label a8a0d7d7 with FEI 3004956904 and its last inspection was classified NAI on 2024-07-26.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for that FEI show multiple VAI classifications from 2010 through 2020, with the most recent VAI known date of 2020-06-11.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A separate FDA shortage posting notes Amneal Pharmaceuticals' nitrofurantoin oral suspension is to be discontinued as of 2026-04-10, but this does not place nitrofurantoin on the current shortage list.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    }
  ]
}
